0..81 Comment "//! `Generated` and `Wider` state extension signatures over finite face theories."
82..85 Comment "//!"
86..159 Comment "//! The signatures show the behaviour of `ext` over two and three points."
160..163 Comment "//!"
164..239 Comment "//! The checker derives each boundary, β and η law from its `ext` member."
240..243 Comment "//!"
244..259 Comment "//! - see: #641"
260..331 Comment "//! - cites: [Zhang-2024-three_noncubical_applications_extension_types]"
332..335 Comment "//!"
336..491 Comment "//! [Zhang-2024-three_noncubical_applications_extension_types]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.05658 \"Zhang, Three non-cubical applications of extension types\""
492..495 Comment "//!"
